    <node id="&quot;SECRETARIA DE ATENÇÃO À SAÚDE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">The **Secretaria de Atenção à Saúde** is a department within the **Ministério da Saúde** (Brazilian Ministry of Health) responsible for providing healthcare services.  

It focuses on addressing public health issues and overseeing health services and policies within Brazil. The Secretaria de Atenção à Saúde plays a crucial role in delivering primary healthcare and managing healthcare actions and programs throughout the country. 
</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-ba9e0948e4a9ab4cfef851b3d04569f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dcc086fd1fd42c072828e9d7087e5319&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8cd85691af5825ade0ebb0bf7e8363a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06b32da1d1973f6716bf6a88b0804f92&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb3eab63e277848273beaa2f384a54c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab766c42d28a05883a32d4ec6e1f3138&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a44aa1a3fcb2e63cef48ccb0a0743b59&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a9738505c5e6c2235df2341fc850cc6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2aec6be4c7bee1e546e8178355b886b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8edc7a33a325b54944fe9b4a1090c1c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea63d053e17dea4e69d15b3295fd103d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56b717d5c3fa4fdb1d7a513fef54947f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c771d624691f882ba20218b39478d3bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e81395f650fcc8fa2920951650fa581&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4cef3c09404097d781dc4d636b641c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-52bedd429db8fecb749f90106d56cf89&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73641b3d7315f12773cbeba6757a87dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b55dec6543a63e467a6bcd7a9548f291&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a028759c6d384f978812fb05cb32fea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8662c1bde799dfa0466be1e7bbc482fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c53ed59f6b0e98e93fb5837fe2400963&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93f9573a4fc9a510c01c7f0b2eafc06c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f141b736f4ceb1b987e4b08b6058c503&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d6d06a5132611f9acdf1b2708a6502ba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c6a9d8e3049fe12d43afcc2fd338355&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd9b26e2a22718e03b18a6df3a47562c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1916bf2c451ba014e661b5fb8ba12bd3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fed670db07abcbf6faa4bd86f6354f93&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d5d51b9e21c5585215061bb5f7020be5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b87f971b06b5cc3a0ada9a660834671f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f246af066137086d88f024d2f4529e2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9c66e12640babdcc62f4a059f486ea1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d7ae9031cba3be486096f40b70f5257&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-10ba5d9481de4afdef97e47b4183a521&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e574f6533929f278659931cc90e1d1b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e8d52f061cea25189e68964e3e58d23&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57193e32eeb26daa2e72d3f55ff5e44b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-87c341ea69f31b94b6ce3a8697ccceb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1efe2fd4f371b41d17038bcb0b052b00&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-15e541a54a4fba14592051d8d60b1d24&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-044051a3a5634