    <node id="&quot;CADERNOS DE ATENÇÃO BÁSICA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A publication series called Cadernos de Atenção Básica provides guidance on health care."&lt;SEP&gt;"A publication series focused on primary healthcare by the Ministério da Saúde."&lt;SEP&gt;"A series of publications focused on basic healthcare strategies."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cadernos de Atenção Básica is a publication focused on primary healthcare, serving as a resource for professionals."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Cadernos de Atenção Básica series of publications is described as a resource for healthcare professionals."&lt;SEP&gt;"A series of publications called 'Cadernos de Atenção Básica' providing guidelines and strategies for healthcare."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cadernos de Atenção Básica is a publication series that includes detailed information about nutritional guidelines."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-dcc086fd1fd42c072828e9d7087e5319&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89a7be0de091ae674719002bc69923cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1916bf2c451ba014e661b5fb8ba12bd3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5f81f4594a00ed9200f155cbc073a8d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-00b178b50574e94e266596befae28ef8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8662c1bde799dfa0466be1e7bbc482fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d7ae9031cba3be486096f40b70f5257</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;OBESIDADE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A condition characterized by excess body fat."&lt;SEP&gt;"Obesidade is a severe form of excess weight characterized by a high BMI, significantly increasing the risk of various chronic diseases."&lt;SEP&gt;"Obesidade refers to a chronic health condition characterized by excessive body fat."&lt;SEP&gt;"Obesidade" refers to obesity, another classification of nutritional status."&lt;SEP&gt;"Obesidade" refers to the condition of being obese, a health metric used to classify individuals."&lt;SEP&gt;"Obesity is a chronic disease addressed in the document."&lt;SEP&gt;"Obesity is a health condition addressed in the document, highlighting its importance."&lt;SEP&gt;"Obesity is a health condition addressed in the document."&lt;SEP&gt;"Obesity is a more severe form of excess weight characterized by significantly higher BMI levels and associated health risks."&lt;SEP&gt;"Obesity is the central health concern addressed in this document."&lt;SEP&gt;"Represents the state of being overweight or having excess body fat."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-8e55e309cf9a66e4387eeff8a0af7488&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ec2f538affbc0d158e945d160c958c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dcc086fd1fd42c072828e9d7087e5319&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61a895fe92a5f203b2082d7261f258a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93f9573a4fc9a510c01c7f0b2eafc06c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1916bf2c451ba014e661b5fb8ba12bd3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76c04ba1e4fb949ee77d055a715ba628&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c33eade0ff4548e7dc05c486bf5742b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f141b736f4ceb1b987e4b08b6058c503&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ddf64de731dcd792692d7caa0df4b741&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73641b3d7315f12773cbeba6757a87dd</data>
    </node>
