    <node id="&quot;DEPARTAMENTO DE ATENÇÃO BÁSICA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">**DEPARTAMENTO DE ATENÇÃO BÁSICA**, a department within **Secretaria de Atenção à Saúde**, which is part of the **Ministério da Saúde (Brazilian Ministry of Health)**, is responsible for providing basic healthcare services throughout Brazil.  

Its primary focus is on delivering primary and preventative care, along with publishing guidelines and offering support for primary healthcare services across the country. The department also develops policies and strategies aimed at improving access to and the quality of basic healthcare within Brazil. 
</data>
