    <node id="&quot;DIABETES TIPO 1&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Diabetes Tipo 1 is a type of diabetes that requires monitoring for nephropathy development, typically starting five years after diagnosis."&lt;SEP&gt;"Type 1 Diabetes is a form of diabetes characterized by an autoimmune destruction of insulin-producing beta cells, requiring lifelong insulin therapy."&lt;SEP&gt;"Type 1 Diabetes is an autoimmune disease characterized by insulin deficiency."&lt;SEP&gt;"Type 1 diabetes refers to an autoimmune disease where the body's immune system attacks insulin-producing cells in the pancreas."</data>
