    <edge source="&quot;SECRETARIA DE ATENÇÃO À SAÚDE&quot;" target="&quot;MINISTÉRIO DA SAÚDE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">216.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Both the **MINISTÉRIO DA SAÚDE** (Ministry of Health) and the **SECRETARIA DE ATENÇÃO À SAÚDE** (Secretariat of Health Care) are key entities within the Brazilian healthcare system. 

The  SECRETARIA DE ATENÇÃO À SAÚDE is a department directly under the authority of the MINISTÉRIO DA SAÚDE. This hierarchical relationship signifies that the Secretariat operates as a subordinate division responsible for overseeing health services and policies. The Secretariat focuses on delivering healthcare services and implementing directives from the Ministry of Health. It reports to the MINISTÉRIO DA SAÚDE and carries out its instructions regarding healthcare matters within Brazil.  
</data>
      <data key="d5">"governance, hierarchy"&lt;SEP&gt;"hierarchical relationship, public health governance"&lt;SEP&gt;"hierarchy, administration"&lt;SEP&gt;"hierarchy, organizational structure"&lt;SEP&gt;"hierarchy, policy implementation"&lt;SEP&gt;"hierarchy, public health administration"&lt;SEP&gt;"organizational hierarchy"&lt;SEP&gt;"organizational hierarchy, administration"&lt;SEP&gt;"organizational hierarchy, government structure"&lt;SEP&gt;"organizational hierarchy, governmental structure"&lt;SEP&gt;"organizational structure"&lt;SEP&gt;"organizational structure, hierarchy"&lt;SEP&gt;9</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-ba9e0948e4a9ab4cfef851b3d04569f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dcc086fd1fd42c072828e9d7087e5319&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06b32da1d1973f6716bf6a88b0804f92&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb3eab63e277848273beaa2f384a54c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab766c42d28a05883a32d4ec6e1f3138&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56b717d5c3fa4fdb1d7a513fef54947f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2aec6be4c7bee1e546e8178355b886b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8edc7a33a325b54944fe9b4a1090c1c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c771d624691f882ba20218b39478d3bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73641b3d7315f12773cbeba6757a87dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a028759c6d384f978812fb05cb32fea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8662c1bde799dfa0466be1e7bbc482fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93f9573a4fc9a510c01c7f0b2eafc06c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f141b736f4ceb1b987e4b08b6058c503&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1916bf2c451ba014e661b5fb8ba12bd3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fed670db07abcbf6faa4bd86f6354f93&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d5d51b9e21c5585215061bb5f7020be5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b87f971b06b5cc3a0ada9a660834671f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f246af066137086d88f024d2f4529e2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d7ae9031cba3be486096f40b70f5257&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e574f6533929f278659931cc90e1d1b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e8d52f061cea25189e68964e3e58d23&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6c011362692bde18683056a36c8d89d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-079ce53674c02de0c3cdfde222e87cdc</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;SECRETARIA DE ATENÇÃO À SAÚDE&quot;" target="&quot;DEPARTAMENTO DE ATENÇÃO BÁSICA&quot;">
      <data key="d3">170.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Both the **DEPARTAMENTO DE ATENÇÃO BÁSICA** (Basic Attention Department) and the **SECRETARIA DE ATENÇÃO À SAÚDE** (Secretariat of Health Care) are key players in the Brazilian healthcare system.  The DEPARTAMENTO DE ATENÇÃO BÁSICA operates as a department or division within the SECRETARIA DE ATENÇÃO À SAÚDE, focusing primarily on primary healthcare delivery and policies. This hierarchical relationship signifies that the SECRETARIA DE ATENÇÃO À SAÚDE oversees the DEPARTAMENTO DE ATENÇÃO BÁSICA,  and the latter is responsible for specific tasks within basic healthcare delivery in Brazil. 


</data>
      <data key="d5">"departmental structure, healthcare provision"&lt;SEP&gt;"division of labor, governmental function"&lt;SEP&gt;"hierarchical relationship, public health organization"&lt;SEP&gt;"hierarchy, organizational structure"&lt;SEP&gt;"hierarchy, public health administration"&lt;SEP&gt;"organizational hierarchy"&lt;SEP&gt;"organizational hierarchy, health management"&lt;SEP&gt;"organizational hierarchy, healthcare delivery"&lt;SEP&gt;"organizational hierarchy, specialized function"&lt;SEP&gt;"organizational structure"&lt;SEP&gt;"organizational structure, hierarchy"&lt;SEP&gt;"organizational structure, specialization"&lt;SEP&gt;"subordinate relationship, healthcare focus"&lt;SEP&gt;"subordinate, departmental organization"|&gt;&lt;|8&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;7&lt;SEP&gt;8</data>
